Therefore we get an exact sequence #math.equation(block: true, numbering: none, $0 arrow.r E_(k\,r)^oo arrow.r H_r\(F\)arrow.r H_(r + k - 1)\(F\)arrow.r E_(0\,r + k - 1)^oo arrow.r 0$) Replace $r$ with $n - k$, we get #math.equation(block: true, numbering: none, $0 arrow.r E_(k\,n - k)^oo arrow.r H_(n - k)\(F\)arrow.r H_(n - 1)\(F\)arrow.r E_(0\,n - 1)^oo arrow.r 0$) Since $H_n\(E\)= E_(k\,n - k)^oo xor E_(0\,n)^oo$, there is also an exact sequence #math.equation(block: true, numbering: none, $0 arrow.r E_(k\,n - k)^oo arrow.r H_n\(E\)arrow.r E_(0\,n)^oo arrow.r 0$) Put them together, we get the #strong[Wang sequence]#index-entry("Wang sequence") #math.equation(block: true, numbering: none, $dots.h.c arrow.r H_n\(E\)arrow.r H_(n - k)\(F\)arrow.r H_(n - 1)\(F\)arrow.r H_(n - 1)\(E\)arrow.r dots.h.c$)

