 & = bb(Z) times.o_(bb(Z)\[G\]) H_n (frac(C_(*)\(X\), F_(n - 1) C_(*)\(X\)))^t = H_0 (G \; H_n (frac(C_(*)\(X\), F_(n - 1) C_(*)\(X\)))^t)\
