 & = H_n (frac(bb(Z) times.o_(bb(Z)\[G\]) C_(*)\(X\), bb(Z) times.o_(bb(Z)\[G\]) F_(n - 1) C_(*)\(X\))) = H_n (frac(H_0\(G\;C_(*)\(X\)\), H_0\(G\;F_(n - 1) C_(*)\(X\)\)))\
